EmitSectionModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Forms a WASM section body: [id byte] + U32LEB(payload length) + payload. Universal constructor of all sections (type/function/export/code/...).
    Provides: EmitSection(sid, payload) -> out. sid — Int (section id), payload — body byte list; returns the ready-section byte list.
    DependsOn: EmitU32LEB (payload length encoding).
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../EmitSection/EmitSection.sir).
    Notes: length counted over payload, not over the total — WASM standard.
